acceptance_criteria: Host-bound extension SDK mutation writes settings and workspace history atomically; Packed extension without local CLI SDK dependency passes strict health and rollback tests
parent: pm-o2kc
risk: high
confidence: 80
severity: high
expected_result: "Extension settings updates are atomic, audited and pass strict health."
actual_result: pm-presets applies directly to settings.json and strict health reports workspace history drift.
