comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-29T00:20:00.805Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: all-status PM search for audited extension settings mutation found related closed workspace-audit and SDK audits but no current owner of this missing host-bound contract. GitHub #1345 cites pm-presets pm-1vx6 in that package's tracker; that is a separate consumer defect."
body: "GitHub: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1345\n\nExpose a typed extension-command SDK operation for lock-scoped audited singleton mutation with invocation identity, atomic write and history, compensation, idempotence, and dry-run. Prove a packed extension without a local host SDK dependency can apply settings and pass strict health."
